REQUIRED — blunders.eval_loss_cp. This column persists the raw uncapped delta at recording time (app/api/blunder.py:252 and :422) and directly feeds the /stats library card: avg_blunder_eval_loss_cp and the top_costly_blunders list (ORDER BY eval_loss_cp DESC), so ~10000cp mate blunders permanently squat the top-5 and skew the average no matter where the new cap is implemented.
