CONDITIONAL — session_moves.eval_delta. Needed ONLY if the cap is implemented write-side (worker/upload). If the cap lands in the shared read path instead (centipawn_loss() + centipawn_loss_expr(), which /history summaries and the session export already funnel through), historical Avg CPL is fixed at read time with no data change. Read-path cap is the recommended fix for exactly this reason.
