OPTIONAL — analysis_cache.eval_delta. Also holds inflated values, but no consumer DECISION changes at a 1000 cap: drill strictness and recordable thresholds are all <=150cp, so 10000 vs 1000 grade identically. Backfill is display-consistency only; skip unless cache eval_delta becomes user-visible.

