4. **Adjust Graph Height & Margins (`src/App.css`):**
   - Update `.chessboard-wrapper .analysis-graph > svg` height rules to target `.chess-graph-area .analysis-graph > svg` so the fixed 220px (and 330px on mobile) sizing is maintained.
   - Rebalance spacing: Remove or adjust the `margin-top` on `.analysis-graph` and `.game-end-banner` when they are inside `.chess-graph-area`, since the grid `gap` will now provide the vertical spacing.

